wlanpi-menud (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: Phase 1 menu service (manifests, sessions, jobs,
    local.sock and proxy.sock, core client).
  * Debian packaging: dh-virtualenv under /opt/wlanpi-menud (Python 3.13),
    systemd unit as wlanpi, tmpfiles.d runtime dir, get-core-token root
    helper with sudoers entry, schemas and built-in manifests under
    /usr/share/wlanpi-menud.

